+# Billing support
+
+The refund window is 30 days. Treat `/src/billing.ts` as the implementation authority for this limit.
+
+No invoice-specific policy is established in the connected billing implementation. For invoice questions, use available project evidence and escalate when it does not support a definite answer; do not invent invoice timing, status, eligibility, or remedies.

